# Paths `clt scan` skips when harvesting TODO(clt): markers.
# Exact path, `dir/` prefix, or a trailing `*` wildcard. One per line.
#
# This project is the pathological case for its own scanner: the docs explain
# the marker syntax and the tests are built out of markers. Raw string literals
# in particular defeat quote-counting by design, which is what this file is for.
README.md
src/scan.rs
